@startuml
!theme sunlust
class MediaPlayer {
    -state: PlayerState
    -currentMedia: string
    +play(): void
    +pause(): void
    +stop(): void
}

interface PlayerState {
    +play(MediaPlayer): void
    +pause(MediaPlayer): void
    +stop(MediaPlayer): void
}

class StoppedState {
    +play(): void
}

class PlayingState {
    +pause(): void
    +stop(): void
}

class PausedState {
    +play(): void
    +stop(): void
}

MediaPlayer o--> PlayerState
PlayerState <|.. StoppedState
PlayerState <|.. PlayingState
PlayerState <|.. PausedState

StoppedState --> PlayingState : play()
PlayingState --> PausedState : pause()
PlayingState --> StoppedState : stop()
PausedState --> PlayingState : play()
PausedState --> StoppedState : stop()

note bottom of MediaPlayer
    User controls trigger
    state transitions
end note
@enduml